<title>CHINA: Thai Farmers Bank signs $150 mln FRCD.</title>
<headline>Thai Farmers Bank signs $150 mln FRCD.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thai Farmers Bank's US$150 million floating-rate certificates of deposit issue was completed on a club basis and signed on Friday, arranger DKB Asia said.</p>
<p>The five-year issue, which was launched through the bank's Hong Kong branch, was priced at par to float at 35 basis points over the six-month London Interbank Offered Rate.</p>
<p>With fees, the all-in return for top-tier manager is 42 basis points.</p>
<p>DKB Asia, Asahi Finance (HK), Development Bank of Singapore, Dresdner (South East Asia) and Tokyo-Mitsubishi International (HK) are the arrangers.</p>
<p>Norinchukin Bank is the co-arranger.</p>
<p>BZW Asia is the senior manager.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6960</p>
